# The image builds need only the Rust workspace and the web client. Everything else stays out of the build context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
# the offline query data the core's SQL is checked against, and the setting that makes the build use it
!.sqlx/
!.cargo/
# the web client's source, for the web image (its build writes build/ and csp.caddy, and installs its own node_modules)
!apps/web/
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/build
apps/web/.svelte-kit
apps/web/csp.caddy
